OL,3,GNEWSAChristie's disappearance featured
OL,4,Aat new exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe only known surviving copy of a
OL,7,Fmissing persons poster produced by
OL,8,Fpolice after Agatha Christie
OL,9,Fdisappeared in 1926 is one of the items
OL,10,Fon display at a new exhibition.
OL,12,FThe celebrated crime writer went
OL,13,Fmissing from her Sunningdale home,
OL,14,FStyles, on 3 December 1926. Her car was
OL,15,Ffound in the Surrey countryside a day
OL,16,Flater and she was found at a hotel in
OL,17,FHarrogate on 14 December.
OL,19,FIt is now thought she had a breakdown
OL,20,Fafter her husband announced he was
OL,21,Fleaving her for another woman.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
