OL,3,GNEWSAChristie's disappearance featured
OL,4,Aat new exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe poster made by police in Wokingham
OL,7,Fforms part of a free exhibition at the
OL,8,FRoyal Berkshire Archives in Reading
OL,9,Fthat runs until 18 December.
